WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.168
MyCampusView Academy.

2
00:00:03.218 --> 00:00:05.911
AI for Teens, video 3.

3
00:00:05.961 --> 00:00:08.030
Data inventories.

4
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:13.950
List what you have, what you lack, and what would be unethical to collect.

5
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:19.805
Each example has features you can measure and a label you want

6
00:00:19.855 --> 00:00:21.216
the model to learn.

7
00:00:21.266 --> 00:00:22.330
Inventory both.

8
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:26.977
How many labelled examples do you have?

9
00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:31.048
Which groups, languages or devices are missing?

10
00:00:31.098 --> 00:00:33.386
Which fields are sensitive?

11
00:00:33.436 --> 00:00:36.590
Do you have consent for this purpose?

12
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:41.489
Do not collect personal fields just in case.

13
00:00:41.539 --> 00:00:45.730
Extra data creates risk without improving the model.

14
00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:48.477
Let us recap.

15
00:00:48.527 --> 00:00:53.070
Data inventories reveal gaps and risks early.

16
00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:56.336
Minimum necessary data is safer.

17
